<title>USA: Union Pacific Corp Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific Corp Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>BETHELEHEM, Pa. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.00		    $0.78</p>
<p> Shr			   1.30		     1.15</p>
<p> Cont oper income     211,000		  160,000</p>
<p> Net income	     275,000		  237,000</p>
<p> Oper rev	     1,996,000		1,974,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     N/A			N/A</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $2.42		    $2.14</p>
<p> Shr			   3.24		     3.17</p>
<p> Cont oper income     504,000		  440,000</p>
<p> Net income	     675,000		  652,000</p>
<p> Oper rev	     5,976,000		5,512,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 208,500		  205,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for Q3 was $1.00 per share</p>
<p>Net income included income from Union Pacific Resources Group Inc, which was spun off and is being reported as a discontinued operation.</p>
